WEBVTT

00:02:55.860 --> 00:03:01.156
And we start by planting
the first 500,000 seedlings

00:03:01.180 --> 00:03:02.638
this rainy season.

00:03:03.123 --> 00:03:07.276
For this to work,
we need to involve everyone.

00:03:07.300 --> 00:03:12.855
We need to make our city collectively
proud of what we can do together

00:03:12.879 --> 00:03:15.136
to protect ourselves

00:03:15.160 --> 00:03:16.623
and our homes.

00:03:17.140 --> 00:03:18.786
For nearly a year now,

00:03:18.810 --> 00:03:24.256
15 different species of trees
have been nursed on 11 sites

00:03:24.280 --> 00:03:25.916
across the city.

00:03:25.940 --> 00:03:32.226
And now each tree will be planted
in a home, a school,